            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick a folder in iCloud Drive: your archive (items, tags, folders, notes, highlights, pictures and videos you added) is backed up there. If you switch phones, just pick the same folder; if you also use wroopmark on a Mac, both devices sync automatically."
